## Staging DNS

After the first staging deploy, point the staging domain at the new load balancer:

```sh
pnpx @soliantconsulting/sld-dns-control-client point-staging-domain
```

This reads `.sld-dns-control.json`, finds the deployed stack's auto-emitted
`LoadBalancerDNS` output, and upserts the CNAME via the DNS control API. Only needed once after
the initial deploy; subsequent deploys keep the same load balancer.
{%- endif %}
