## Using Cognito instead of Auth0

Fill `[jwt]` in `dev-app-config.toml` (copied from the `.dist`) and in AppConfig from the
`create-cognito` stack outputs.

Set `userPoolArn` in `packages/cdk/src/env-*.ts` to the `UserPoolArn` output. Synth fails while it
is empty, malformed, or in another account or region than the stack. The API can then manage users
in that pool (invite, disable, delete, reset password, manage groups) without a stored secret.

Guard admin routes with `requireGroup("admin")` from `src/util/auth.ts`. Only access tokens from the
listed clients are accepted; ID tokens get a 401.
{%- endif %}
